</div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap">
<h2>What you leave with</h2>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card"><h3>The decisions</h3><p>The reporting has to support them, in the words leadership already uses in the meeting.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>The data</h3><p>We mark where the data is too weak for someone to defend the number.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>The path</h3><p>It is one Power BI setup that can answer the next question from the same numbers.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>The order</h3><p>This is what your team does first, and what it leaves alone until that work is finished.</p></article>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="band related-links" aria-labelledby="related-services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="related-services">Related Power BI Services</h2>
